32256::$$$message_0257_0000_0000$$$::No matter how many times I've been here, the church never changes.[lr]::
32257::$$$message_0257_0000_0001$$$::Saber doesn't notice anything untoward, either.[lr]::
32258::$$$message_0257_0000_0002$$$::There's nothing here anymore.[lr]::
32259::$$$message_0257_0000_0003$$$::We should move on.[lr]::
32260::$$$message_0257_0000_0004$$$::I hope I have a concrete reason for coming here next time.::
932256::$$$message_9257_0000_0000$$$::No matter how many times I've been here, the church never changes.[r] 	³}